                         "description":  "Basic usage",
                         "command":  "AscetCli.exe exec list_diagrams \u003ccomponent-path\u003e [--diagram-kind \u003call|block|block_diagram|state|state_machine|sequence|unknown\u003e] [--json]"
                     }
                 ],
